|› show me the corpus                                                            |
|                                                                                |
|A line that ends in a backslash\                                                |
|continues on the next row.                                                      |
|                                                                                |
|An ampersand written as &amp;, a tag as &lt;tag&gt;, a copy as &copy; and a     |
|number as &#169;.                                                               |
|                                                                                |
|An empty reference &#0; and an override &#x202E; are written as they came.      |
|                                                                                |
|~one~ is struck under GitHub's rules, and ~~two~~ is struck under both.         |
|                                                                                |
|A pair may cross a line break: ~the phrase goes                                 |
|on~ here.                                                                       |
|                                                                                |
|And these strike nothing: edit ~/.config/crucible/config.json then ~/bin/run,   |
|between ~/a and ~/b, about ~5 minutes or ~10.                                   |
